  "subtitle": "A precision lab balance reduced to a single sliding control bar and a bar-graph stability display.",
  "why_scout_cares": "The interface philosophy IS the instrument: no membrane keys, no rotary knobs — one horizontal aluminum control bar executes tare/calibrate/print/mode, paired with a DeltaDisplay bar-graph overlay instead of a numeric field. Won the 1983 iF Design Award explicitly for its interaction model.",
